\">Worm</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>You may face <a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Shambler\">Crypt Shamblers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummies</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghosts</a> if they are lured.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route Thais - Kazordoon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"230\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_Thais_Kazordoon_68188f.png\" width=\"789\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li>Go into <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a>, where you will probably find <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a></li>\n<li>Now follow the way from green to red circles, here you might face all monsters listed above</li>\n<li>Then follow the map below</li></ol>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route Thais - Kazordoon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_Thais_Kazordoon_2_28c453.png\" width=\"227\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Luring</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum\">Mount Sternum</a></li></ul></div>","quests":[]}